Usage:
  nr-gnb -c <config-file> [option...]

Options:
  -c, --config <config-file>  Use specified configuration file for gNB
  -l, --disable-cmd           Disable command line functionality for this instance
  -h, --help                  Show this help message and exit
  -v, --version               Show version information and exit
